   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. HRDO Academy/ Analytical Hub established.
2. Enhancing HRDO monitoring function of the rights of vulnerable groups and implementation of recommendations in place.
3. Strengthened capacity of the HRDO on conventional bodies.
4. Capacity of the HRDO to act as an Equality Body.
5. Digital information management system in the regional HRDO offices deployed.
6. Number of regional offices of the HRDO set and operational.
7. Work management software for the Office of the Representative before the ECtHR developed and operational.
8. Strengthened capacity of the Office of the Representative before the ECtHR.
9. A large-scale national communications campaign (accessible for people with disabilities) designed and launched/ number of people reached.
10. Number of professional trainings provided.
11. Number of modules on HR and non-discrimination introduced.
12. Evaluation of the progress of implementation of the HRAP conducted.
13. New iteration of HR Action Plan and related strategic documents developed.
14. Number of public awareness products on HRAP implementation.
15. Number of police units audio-visual recordings of police interviews are introduced.
16. New Patrol Police officers are trained.</narrative>
    </description>
